>]]></description><link>https://x.com/nikillinit/status/1922739945288106441?s=46</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/nikillinit/status/1922739945288106441?s=46</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 15:50:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nate Soares and Eliezer have a book coming out]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gq7YwRJX0AAkMEI.jpg:large"></p><p>Nate Soares ⏹️ (@So8res) on X</p><p>I wrote a book with Eliezer Yudkowsky. It’s about how smarter-than-human AI is on track to kill us all, written in hopes of bringing the conversation into the mainstream. Lots of people are alarmed; ~nobody wants to sound alarmist. The time is ripe. Preorders help. Link below.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/So8res/status/1922712807981678945">https://x.com/So8res/status/1922712807981678945</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/friday-assorted-links-521.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=friday-assorted-links-521">Friday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/So8res/status/1922712807981678945</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/So8res/status/1922712807981678945</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 15:50:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The wisdom of Andrew Batson]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1525527361734574083/rR6YMGbo_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Andrew Batson (@andrewbatson) on X</p><p>@Shahinvallee @adam_tooze @Brad_Setser @energybants @sobel_mark @pogourinchas @SanderTordoir @EuroBriefing @martinwolf_ @IMFNews @robin_j_brooks @ErikFossing @Ej_Europe maybe people have finally figured out that the “global imbalances” stuff was never a coherent intellectual framework to begin with.…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/andrewbatson/status/1922744667310797205">https://x.com/andrewbatson/status/1922744667310797205</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05